  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Locro de papa builds on a simple "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sofrito"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "sofrito"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " base before the potatoes go in. The soup thickens naturally as the potato starch starts "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "breaking-down"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "breaking down"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " into the liquid. Stirring in cheese at the end makes the broth rich and slightly stringy. The avocado on top is the cold contrast that makes the soup complete."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: use two types of potato. A floury one breaks down to thicken the soup; a waxy one holds its shape to give texture."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
